-person adventure through a family's home. Creepy music and sound effects create the tense atmosphere that instills a foreboding feeling, an expectation of something bad about to happen. This game was created in 10 hours at Galway Game Jam 7 in Galway, Ireland.", "themes": [{"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/july-4th-1976", "videos": [{"id": 153562, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "Q3LNci3H3jY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q3LNci3H3jY", "title": "Let's Play: John Romero's  July 4, 1976", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Q3LNci3H3jY/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}